.TH man 1 "11 August 2025" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME 
	killproc - kill process by name
.SH SYNOPSIS
	killproc processname
.SH DESCRIPTION
	iteratively kills all processes in ps aux that contain the given name. 
.SH OPTIONS
	there probably should be some
.SH EXAMPLES
	killproc discord
.br
	killproc http.server (equivalent to stopserver alias)
.SH BUGS
	sometimes throws an error and kills itself maybe
